{
  "url": "https://new.web.cafe/tutorial/detail/lev11f7xoe",
  "title": "next.js 使用supabase接入登录-邮箱方式",
  "author": "我想问问天",
  "authorAvatar": "https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/lev11f7xoe_avatar.jpg",
  "tags": [
    "supabase",
    "next.js"
  ],
  "content": "<h1 style=\"font-size: 1.5rem; line-height: 2rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">前置条件</h1>\n<div>1.会基本的html，css知识</div>\n<div>2.本地已经安装过node，版本大于<a href=\"https://nodejs.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Node.js 12.22.0</a></div>\n<div>3.最好会next.js的基本概念（不会也没关系，如果你完全按照我这个教程来也可以走通流程，可以后续再去学习，可以在油管上搜索下next.js的教程，基本上几个小时看下来就差不多可以上手了）</div>\n<h1 style=\"font-size: 1.5rem; line-height: 2rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">步骤</h1>\n<div>1.访问<a href=\"https://supabase.com/%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%A8%E5%86%8C%E7%99%BB%E5%BD%95%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E8%B4%A6%E5%8F%B7%EF%BC%8C%E6%8E%A5%E7%9D%80%E5%88%9B%E5%BB%BA%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E9%A1%B9%E7%9B%AE%EF%BC%8C%E5%A1%AB%E5%86%99%E5%AE%8C%E9%A1%B9%E7%9B%AE%E5%90%8D%E5%92%8C%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E5%BA%93%E5%AF%86%E7%A0%81%EF%BC%8C%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E5%90%88%E9%80%82%E7%9A%84%E5%8C%BA%E5%9F%9F%E5%90%8E%EF%BC%8C%E7%82%B9%E5%87%BBcreate\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://supabase.com/，注册登录一个账号，接着创建一个项目，填写完项目名和数据库密码，选择一个合适的区域后，点击create</a> new project。</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/lev11f7xoe_img1.png\" alt=\"image-20250308214849607\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>2.首先我们可以在github上创建一个空项目，比如auth-demo。</div>\n<div>然后我们在本地执行</div>\n<pre><div style=\"color: black; background: transparent; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; white-space: pre; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none; padding: 0px; margin: 0.5em 0px; overflow: initial; display: block; border: none;\"><code class=\"language-javascript\" style=\"white-space: pre; color: black; background: none; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none;\"><span>npx create</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">-</span><span>next</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">-</span><span>app </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">-</span><span>e </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 119, 170);\">with</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">-</span><span>supabase</span></code></div></pre>\n<div>输入后会提示让你给项目取一个名字，我们输入auth-demo。</div>\n<div>这个会使用next.js整合supabase，命令输入完等待一会它会自动去下载依赖包和创建工程，给我们本地建一个有基本功能和结构的项目。</div>\n<div>下载完的话目录结构大概跟我这个图是一致的：</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/lev11f7xoe_img2.png\" alt=\"image-20250318230429527\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>2.接着我们修改本地的配置文件，将<code>.env.local.example</code> 修改为 <code>.env.local</code> ，准备填写对应的信息。</div>\n<div>我们回到supabase , 在刚才创建的project里面侧边栏最下面找到settings</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/lev11f7xoe_img3.png\" alt=\"image-20250308215152422\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>也可以直接访问 <a href=\"https://supabase.com/dashboard/project/_/settings/api%E3%80%82%E7%84%B6%E5%90%8E%E6%88%91%E4%BB%AC%E6%89%BE%E5%88%B0%E6%88%91%E4%BB%AC%E7%9A%84project\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://supabase.com/dashboard/project/_/settings/api。然后我们找到我们的project</a> url 和anon key, 分别复制后填入到刚才auth-demo项目的.env.local配置文件中。</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/lev11f7xoe_img4.png\" alt=\"image-20250308215249941\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>3.配置填写完毕之后，我们在项目的根目录里面进入到命令行，输入</div>\n<pre><div style=\"color: black; background: transparent; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; white-space: pre; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none; padding: 0px; margin: 0.5em 0px; overflow: initial; display: block; border: none;\"><code class=\"language-javascript\" style=\"white-space: pre; color: black; background: none; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none;\"><span>npm run dev</span></code></div></pre>\n<div>等待项目启动之后，如果成功运行，访问<a href=\"http://localhost:3000/%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E7%9C%8B%E5%88%B0%E4%B8%8B%E9%9D%A2%E7%9A%84%E7%95%8C%E9%9D%A2%EF%BC%9A\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">http://localhost:3000/可以看到下面的界面：</a></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/lev11f7xoe_img5.png\" alt=\"image-20250308215747228\" loading=\"lazy\">可以看到项目右上角有sign in (登录) ，sign up(注册)。</div>\n<div>我们点击sign up，来到注册页面</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/lev11f7xoe_img6.png\" alt=\"image-20250308215937269\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>这个注册登录就不做过多的解释了，走到这里对接基本的登录流程就完成了，你可以把这个能跑通的代码嵌入到你其他的next.js的项目里面就可以直接使用了。</div>\n<div>4.修改回调地址（<strong>这个是官方文档没有提到的</strong>）</div>\n<div>这个回调地址的配置是会影响，邮箱注册之后，从邮箱的链接点击跳转到网站的地址。进入到supabase-Authentication，如下图，配置好site url和redirect url。</div>\n<div>如果你没有什么其他要求，直接两个地址都填写成你的网站首页地址即可。</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/lev11f7xoe_img7.png\" alt=\"image-20250318225847725\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>5.都弄好之后，我们可以把本地这个项目和远端的github空项目绑定一下，然后推送到远端</div>\n<pre><div style=\"color: black; background: transparent; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; white-space: pre; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none; padding: 0px; margin: 0.5em 0px; overflow: initial; display: block; border: none;\"><code class=\"language-javascript\" style=\"white-space: pre; color: black; background: none; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none;\"><span>git remote add origin git@github</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">.</span><span class=\"token property-access\">com</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">:</span><span>yourName</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">/</span><span>yourRepo</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">.</span><span class=\"token property-access\">git</span></code></div></pre>\n<div>后面的地址换成自己的项目git地址就行，然后执行</div>\n<pre><div style=\"color: black; background: transparent; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; white-space: pre; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none; padding: 0px; margin: 0.5em 0px; overflow: initial; display: block; border: none;\"><code class=\"language-javascript\" style=\"white-space: pre; color: black; background: none; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none;\"><span>git push </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">--</span><span>set</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">-</span><span>upstream origin master</span></code></div></pre>\n<div>推送到远端，这样本地项目就和远端的关联到一起了。</div>\n<h1 style=\"font-size: 1.5rem; line-height: 2rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">参考资料</h1>\n<div><a href=\"https://supabase.com/docs/guides/auth/quickstarts/nextjs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">1.supabase官方文档</a></div>",
